{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/1327","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/1327/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/1327/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/1327/events","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/1327","id":1948138123,"node_id":"I_kwDOCX47u850HjqL","number":1327,"title":"Autogenerate does not support Operator classes for postgres","user":{"login":"tl24","id":3987166,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5ODcxNjY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3987166?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tl24","html_url":"https://github.com/tl24","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tl24/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tl24/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tl24/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tl24/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tl24/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tl24/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tl24/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tl24/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tl24/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":1141241826,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTQxMjQxODI2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working"},{"id":1145866372,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTQ1ODY2Mzcy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/labels/postgresql","name":"postgresql","color":"487cbf","default":false,"description":""},{"id":6096712715,"node_id":"LA_kwDOCX47u88AAAABa2R0Cw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/labels/index%20expressions","name":"index expressions","color":"366071","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2023-10-17T19:50:18Z","updated_at":"2023-11-21T21:07:18Z","closed_at":"2023-11-21T21:07:18Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Describe the bug**\r\nFor data types that support Operator classes in postgres, such as jsonb and jsonb_path_ops, alembic does not load the operator class from the database during autogenerate detection.\r\n\r\nTable definition:\r\n```\r\nclass AuditEvent(Base):\r\n    __tablename__ = \"auditevent\"\r\n    id: Mapped[UUID] = mapped_column(postgresql.UUID(as_uuid=True), primary_key=True)\r\n    document: Mapped[Optional[dict]] = mapped_column(postgresql.JSONB)\r\n    __table_args__ = (\r\n         Index(\r\n                \"ix_auditevent_identifiers\",\r\n                text(\"(document->'identifier') jsonb_path_ops\" ),\r\n                postgresql_using=\"gin\",\r\n         )\r\n   )\r\n```\r\n\r\nRunning autogenerate logs this:\r\n```\r\nINFO  [alembic.autogenerate.compare] Detected changed index 'ix_auditevent_identifiers' on 'auditevent': expression ('INDEX', 'document -> identifier') to ('INDEX', '(document->identifier)       jsonb_path_ops')\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nAlembic should not detect a change in this index since it is already in the database correctly.\r\n\r\n**Versions.**\r\n - OS: Ubuntu 20.04\r\n - Python: 3.9\r\n - Alembic: 1.12.0\r\n - SQLAlchemy: 2.0.22\r\n - Database: Postgres 13.7\r\n - DBAPI: psycopg2\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\nIn SQL alchemy 1.x we used to just get warnings that it couldn't read functional indexes.  Now in 2.0 it tries to re-create the index without the operator classes (jsonb_path_ops)\r\n\r\n**Have a nice day!**\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/1327/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/1327/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}